sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Feature frontend<br/>(shared assistant)
    participant API as Feature backend/API
    participant AI as AI-mode and loop<br/>(host)
    participant Model as Model provider
    participant MCP as MCP server<br/>(host)
    participant RAG as RAG server<br/>(host)
    User->>UI: Ask a question
    UI->>API: POST .../assistant/turns
    API->>AI: POST /api/v1/agent-runs<br/>objective, tool allowlist, corpus scope
    AI-->>API: Run accepted (queued)
    API-->>UI: Turn id
    AI->>Model: PLAN with registered tools only
    Model-->>AI: Structured plan (tool names and arguments)
    par ACT: current facts
        AI->>MCP: tools/call + signed feature/run/call binding
        MCP->>API: Registered tool endpoint (fixed route)
        API-->>MCP: Structured result from owned data
        MCP-->>AI: Validated tool result
    and ACT: project guidance
        AI->>RAG: POST /api/v1/retrieve (fixed feature corpus)
        RAG-->>AI: ready with cited excerpts, or no_match
    end
    AI->>AI: OBSERVE: persist results as evidence
    AI->>Model: ADAPT with evidence marked untrusted
    Model-->>AI: Findings citing evidence ids
    AI->>AI: Check citations, derive confidence,<br/>recheck corpus version, persist answer
    Note over AI: No usable context: the answer is<br/>"insufficient context" with no citations
    loop Until the run ends
        UI->>API: GET turn
        API->>AI: GET run (ownership checked)
        AI-->>API: Status and final answer
        API-->>UI: Answer, citations, confidence
    end
    UI-->>User: Answer with sources and confidence category
